# ---- Radio: a station on the transport ---------------------------------------

# The badge where a track's seek bar goes. Keep it short and shouty — it is a pill.
msgid "LIVE"
msgstr "LIVE"

msgid "Buffering…"
msgstr "Wird gepuffert…"

# Same pill, on a station the user paused. Pausing closes the connection, so this is a state and
# not a hold; a transport verb like the Pause button's would read as the control it isn't.
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Pausiert"

# Heading over the Now Playing panel that replaces "Up Next" while a station plays. Names the
# kind of thing the panel describes, so keep it as short as that one.
msgid "Station"
msgstr "Sender"

